# Report image curation: ignore screenshot drafts by default and allow only
# figures used in the final report or source screenshots used to build them.
docs/screenshots/**
!docs/screenshots/
!docs/screenshots/Module_System.png
!docs/screenshots/Whiteboard_Execution_Validation.png
!docs/screenshots/Whiteboard_Sample3_Tuning.png
!docs/screenshots/Whiteboard_Validation_Examples.png

# Final report figures stored in the new_figures subfolder.
!docs/screenshots/new_figures/
!docs/screenshots/new_figures/MultiUI.png
!docs/screenshots/new_figures/System_Pipeline.png
!docs/screenshots/new_figures/Deployment_Diagram.png
!docs/screenshots/new_figures/Whiteboard.png
!docs/screenshots/new_figures/Calibration_Anchor_Points.png
!docs/screenshots/new_figures/Chess_Pick_Place_Validation.png
!docs/screenshots/new_figures/TicTacToe_Validation.png
!docs/screenshots/new_figures/limitation.png
